<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nkiru Justina Nwogbo - Web Dev Tutor</title>
<style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; }
  body { background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; line-height: 1.6; }
 .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
  header { text-align: center; padding: 60px 0; }
  h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; color: #38bdf8; margin: 40px 0 20px; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
 .subtitle { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #94a3b8; }
 .btns { margin-top: 20px; display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
 .btn { padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
 .btn-primary { background: #38bdf8; color: #0f172a; }
 .btn-secondary { border: 1px solid #38bdf8; color: #38bdf8; }
  section { margin-bottom: 60px; }
 .about { background: #1e293b; padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; }
 .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
 .card { background: #1e293b; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155; }
 .skills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
 .skill { background: #334155; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
 .project-links a { margin-right: 12px; color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none; }
  footer { text-align: center; padding: 40px 0; color: #94a3b8; border-top: 1px solid #334155; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
   .container { padding: 20px 16px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Nkiru Justina Nwogbo</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Full-Stack Web Developer & Technical Tutor | Abuja, Nigeria</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        I teach and build practical web applications using React, Node.js, and Python.
        Focused on helping beginners turn concepts into working projects for health tech and NGO solutions.
      </p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View Projects</a>
        <a href="[your-email]" class="btn btn-secondary">Contact Me</a>
        <a href="[your-cv-link]" class="btn btn-secondary">Download CV</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="about">
      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <p>
        I’m a Software Developer and 3MTT Fellow with a background in Environmental Health Technology.
        Over the last 2 years I’ve built full-stack applications for health data management, e-waste tracking,
        and financial reporting, and supported IT systems at Zenith Life Insurance.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">
        As a tutor, I focus on project-based learning. I break down React, Node.js, and database concepts
        into small, buildable projects so students can learn by doing and have portfolio-ready work in 4-8 weeks.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Core Skills</h2>
      <div class="skills">
        <span class="skill">React</span><span class="skill">Node.js</span><span class="skill">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="skill">Python</span><span class="skill">PostgreSQL</span><span class="skill">MongoDB</span>
        <span class="skill">REST APIs</span><span class="skill">Tailwind CSS</span><span class="skill">Git</span>
        <span class="skill">Project-Based Teaching</span><span class="skill">Code Review</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
      <h2>Selected Projects</h2>
      <div class="grid">

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Re-Route E-Waste Management Platform</h3>
          <p><strong>What it does:</strong> Connects Abuja residents to certified e-waste collectors with admin dashboards.</p>
          <p><strong>Tech:</strong> React, Node.js, MongoDB, JWT, Tailwind</p>
          <p><strong>Concepts taught:</strong> Component structure, protected routes, CRUD APIs, deployment</p>
          <div class="project-links" style="margin-top: 12px;">
            <a href="[live-link]">Live Demo</a>
            <a href="[github-link]">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Personal Finance Tracker for Health Fellows</h3>
          <p><strong>What it does:</strong> Role-based tracker for 12 health fellows to log income, expenses, and generate reports.</p>
          <p><strong>Tech:</strong> React, Node.js, PostgreSQL, Chart.js</p>
          <p><strong>Concepts taught:</strong> Relational DB design, data visualization, authentication</p>
          <div class="project-links" style="margin-top: 12px;">
            <a href="[live-link]">Live Demo</a>
            <a href="[github-link]">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Clinic Management System - Prototype</h3>
          <p><strong>What it does:</strong> Patient registration, appointments, and records for low-bandwidth clinics.</p>
          <p><strong>Tech:</strong> React, Node.js, MongoDB, Responsive Design</p>
          <p><strong>Concepts taught:</strong> State management, REST API design, error handling</p>
          <div class="project-links" style="margin-top: 12px;">
            <a href="[github-link]">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Teaching Approach</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p><strong>Method:</strong> 70% hands-on projects, 30% theory. Every 2 weeks students ship a mini-project for their portfolio.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><strong>Experience:</strong> Mentored 5 junior developers through 3MTT peer learning sessions. Created lesson materials for HTML/CSS, JavaScript fundamentals, and API consumption. Comfortable teaching in-person and remote.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><strong>Outcome:</strong> By week 6, students can build and deploy a full CRUD app and explain it in an interview.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>Open to Full-Time Web Development Tutor roles in Abuja and remote.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px;">
          Email: [your email] <br>
          LinkedIn: [your linkedin] <br>
          GitHub: [your github] <br>
          Location: Abuja, Nigeria
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p>© 2026 Nkiru Justina Nwogbo. Built for teaching and impact.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>